<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5074336e55d955b0\" href=\"?note=5074336e55d955b0\" title=\"67-df-degree-join-witness\">67-df-degree-join-witness</a> 定义的局部最小上界缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{JoinWitness}_T(a,b;a\\vee_Tb).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{JoinWitness}_T(a,b;a\\vee_Tb).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>并的泛性质给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\leq_Ta\\vee_Tb\">\\(a,b\\leq_Ta\\vee_Tb\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\leq_Td\">\\(a,b\\leq_Td\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\vee_Tb\\leq_Td\">\\(a\\vee_Tb\\leq_Td\\)</span>，代入定义得到结论。这里只保留原有的格论推论，并按内容修正名称，不声称证明了另外一种 exact-pair 定理。原有最小上界存在性条目保持不变；来源页码沿用输入档案，本轮未重新核验原书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-join-witness","status":"resolved","id":"5074336e55d955b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-join-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]] 的固定基础理论及分配格运算。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-join-witness","status":"resolved","id":"5074336e55d955b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","loca